---
import MetaPage from "@/components/MetaPage.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <MetaPage slot="head" />
  <h1 class="text-8xl">Zach Joe</h1>
  <h2 class="text-4xl my-4">Full Stack Developer</h2>
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold my-12">My work lasts.</h2>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-lg">
    <p>Hello! Thank you so much for visiting my personal website.</p>
    <p>
      I aspire to build applications and tools that solve problems. These
      problems could be mundane or trivial, but they must be real.
    </p>
    <p>
      I believe that done is better than perfect. Everything about me is a
      massive work in progress; but if I came this far, I might as well go even
      further. I am thrilled and even a bit nervous to see what I will become!
    </p>
    <p>
      In life, I am interested in personal finance, house keeping, cooking,
      music, and more. I will post blogs in the future about these, so please
      stay tuned!
    </p>
    <p>
      Please also check out my projects so far, and let me know if you have any
      ideas, comments or suggestions!
    </p>
    <p>
      Once again, it's amazing to have you here! I sincerely hope that you enjoy
      your time at my site.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold my-3">Tech Stack</h2>
  <p class="my-3 text-lg">
    This is my arsenal, means to my end. I use the following tools and more on
    my projects, where I build amazing apps that solve problems I deeply care
    about.
  </p>

  <ol class="flex gap-8 max-sm:flex-col">
    <li>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Front End</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Frameworks</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            React, React Router, Tanstack
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Utilities</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            React Hook Form, Zustand
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Unit and Integration Tests</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            Vitest, React Testing Library
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">UI and Styling</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            Material UI, Tailwind CSS
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>

    <li>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Back End</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Frameworks</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">Express.js</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Database and ORM</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">PostgreSQL, Prisma</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Unit and Integration Tests</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">Jest, Supertest</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Authentication</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            Better Auth, passport.js
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>

    <li>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Full-stack Tools</h3>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Typesafety</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">Typescript</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">End-to-end Testing</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">Playwright</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h4 class="text-lg">Input Verification</h4>
          <p class="dark:text-gray-300 text-gray-500">
            Zod, express-validator (server side)
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </li>
  </ol>
</Layout>
